用フルート"},{"form_id":"0x02B142|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MISC FULL","string":"稽古用太鼓"},{"form_id":"0x00333A|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"太鼓の鼓動"},{"form_id":"0x00333B|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"太鼓の鼓動"},{"form_id":"0x00333D|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"失意の鼓動"},{"form_id":"0x00333F|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"失意の鼓動"},{"form_id":"0x003341|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"魅惑の旋律"},{"form_id":"0x003343|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"魅惑の旋律"},{"form_id":"0x003345|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"赤っ恥"},{"form_id":"0x003347|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"赤っ恥"},{"form_id":"0x003349|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"心躍る旋律"},{"form_id":"0x00334B|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"心躍る旋律"},{"form_id":"0x00334D|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"激しい頭痛"},{"form_id":"0x00334F|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"激しい頭痛"},{"form_id":"0x013C94|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"ALCH FULL","string":"音楽で動物を鎮静"},{"form_id":"0x007EE3|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"音楽について何か教えてくれないか？ (ゴールド100)"},{"form_id":"0x007EE6|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"演奏が上手いな。いくつかコツを教えてくれないか？(100ゴールド)"},{"form_id":"0x0089B3|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"ほら、100セプティムだ。音楽について知っていることを教えてくれ。"},{"form_id":"0x00844B|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"いい歌だ！ これを受け取ってくれ。（10ゴールド）"},{"form_id":"0x02D8EA|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"しーっ…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E8|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そりゃ、ただ悲しいだけだ…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CBE|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"出て行け……さもないと鼻を血まみれにしてやる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC0|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ハハハ！悲しいな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CD1|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめろ！　続けるなら、その足の指を切り落としてやるぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00F0F8|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ブーーーーーー！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CD6|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"恥知らずめ！　牢屋に入れられるべきだ！　出て行け！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE4|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本当に悲しい話だね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE2|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もう嫌だ、もう嫌だ！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE3|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もう嫌だ、もう嫌だ！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C3A4|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（苦しむ声）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01EB40|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（苦しむ物音）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8DF|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"くそっ！　もうたくさんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E0|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"神々よ！　この苦痛！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E1|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"またあいつか...","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E3|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"馬鹿げている。そして、時間を持て余した魔術師どもがやりそうなことだな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E4|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"こんな歳でこんなことになるとは！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"神々が我らすべてをお守りくださいますように……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E6|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おい！　本気を出してすらいないじゃないか！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8E7|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もう、私を怒らせる気ね！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8EB|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いい響きだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8EC|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"さあ、パーティーを始めようぜ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE7|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、よくやった！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8EE|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そうこなくっちゃな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01012E|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"一緒に歌を演奏しない？"},{"form_id":"0x0552A7|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"一緒に歌を演奏しない？"},{"form_id":"0x010133|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"そうだな。君がフルートで、私が太鼓？"},{"form_id":"0x0552A8|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"そうだな。君がフルートで、私が太鼓？"},{"form_id":"0x011C34|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"君がリュートを弾いて、俺が太鼓を叩くのはどうだ？"},{"form_id":"0x0552A9|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"君がリュートを弾いて、俺が太鼓を叩くのはどうだ？"},{"form_id":"0x011C35|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"何でもない… もっと練習しないと。"},{"form_id":"0x01219E|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがフルートを吹くから、ドラムを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x0552AA|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがフルートを吹くから、ドラムを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x0121A1|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがフルートを吹くから、リュートを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x0552AB|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがフルートを吹くから、リュートを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x0121A5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがリュートを弾くから、ドラムを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x0552AD|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがリュートを弾くから、ドラムを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x0121A8|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがリュートを弾くから、フルートを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x0552AE|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"こっちがリュートを弾くから、フルートを頼む。"},{"form_id":"0x014CBF|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"……かつては一人の女がいた、古きストロス・エムカイの春のように美しい夕暮れのような……ああ……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CED|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"...ビールを三杯あおったところで、オークは顔をしかめ、エルフに別れを告げた...誰にも分からぬ、見せかけではない、誰かが死なねばならぬ...ありがとう！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CEE|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああああ、うおおお……歌い続けろ……何だって？！　これは単なる練習だ。ソリチュードの吟遊詩人大学で何年も受け継がれてきたものに過ぎないんだぞ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CEB|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"は！　その程度じゃ足りないぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC4|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふむ、それでは物足りないぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪くないな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC6|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪くないな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC1|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪くないぞ！この調子だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC2|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪くない、悪くない！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC3|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪くないな！ 見習い級の出来だが、確かなものだ。その調子で続けろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC7|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"吟遊詩人の仲間に会えるのはいつでも嬉しいよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CDD|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なかなかやるじゃないか！ その調子で続けろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC8|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"実験を続けろ！　練習すれば上達する。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CD7|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふむ…練習すれば上達するさ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CCE|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その調子だ。実験を続けなさい、練習すれば上達する。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CC9|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"勉強を続けろ！　まだ表面をかじっただけだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CCA|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"続けろ、練習とはそういうものだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CCB|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、悪くないな...たぶん。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CCF|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあいい、練習すれば上達するさ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"練習すれば上達するわよね？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CD2|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ……その調子で頑張れ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CDA|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"正直に言おう、あまり良くない。すまない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CD0|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪くない。鍛冶を始めた頃を思い出すな、はは！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CD5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、もっとひどい話は確かに聞いたことがあるがな……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CDB|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、もっと悪いこともあるさ...","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CDE|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"へへ！　未来の吟遊詩人だな！　その調子だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CDF|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その調子で続ければ、出世するぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE0|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あの吟遊詩人には才能がある、それは認めよう！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE8|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よくやった！ お前が何をしているか分かっているようだな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CEA|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よくやっている、その調子だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x014CE9|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ごめん……あまり良くないんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x02D8F0|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"えーと... そんなに悪くはないな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C39D|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（クンクン鳴く）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x030093|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（クンクン鳴く）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C39F|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（クンクン鳴く）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C39E|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（クンクン鳴く）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C3A1|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（苦しげに鳴く牛）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C3A3|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（苦しげに鳴く牛）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C3A2|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（苦しげに鳴く牛）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C3A5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（苦しげにいななく）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x01C3A6|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（苦しげにいななく）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x005926|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"素晴らしい演奏だ！"},{"form_id":"0x005928|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"完璧な技だ！"},{"form_id":"0x002DC4|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"痛かったが、練習あるのみだ！"},{"form_id":"0x00592B|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"まるで神の介入のように、楽器が壊れる。"},{"form_id":"0x002DC5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"ひどい頭痛に襲われた…（デバフ発動中）"},{"form_id":"0x0038C4|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"ここからは良くなるしかない、そうだろう？"},{"form_id":"0x00592A|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"努力が実を結んだ - いい歌だ！"},{"form_id":"0x00592C|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"その調子！"},{"form_id":"0x002DC6|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"あの演奏はひどかった、恥じるべきだ。(アクティブなデバフ)"},{"form_id":"0x002DCB|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"よくぞここまで来た！"},{"form_id":"0x002DD0|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"先ほどの演奏であなたはインスピレーションを得た。（有効なボーナス）"},{"form_id":"0x0289A5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"演奏するには立っていなければならない！\r\n"},{"form_id":"0x005929|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"忘れがたい演奏だった。"},{"form_id":"0x002DCA|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"また素晴らしい演奏だ！"},{"form_id":"0x002DC7|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"いい歌だ、コツをつかめてきたな！"},{"form_id":"0x005927|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"よくぞここまで来た！"},{"form_id":"0x002DD5|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"あの演奏には楽器すら耐えられなかった！"},{"form_id":"0x0038C2|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"拷問官としてならいつでも食い扶持はあるさ！"},{"form_id":"0x0038BD|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"ひどいな、恥ずかしいと思えよ!"},{"form_id":"0x002DC8|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"最悪の演技ではないが、基準がかなり低かった"},{"form_id":"0x002DD1|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"先ほどの演奏で最高の気分だ（有効なボーナス）"},{"form_id":"0x0038BE|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"世に吟遊詩人はそう何人もいらない!"},{"form_id":"0x0038C3|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"お願い、もうやめて…"},{"form_id":"0x002DD6|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"見事な演舞だ！"},{"form_id":"0x0038C1|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"あの歌は破壊術の達人級呪文に分類されるべきだ。"},{"form_id":"0x0038BF|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"誰もが吟遊詩人に生まれるわけではない！"},{"form_id":"0x005923|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"楽器が壊れた - かえって良かったかもな！"},{"form_id":"0x005924|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"演奏するもんだ、壊すもんじゃない！"},{"form_id":"0x005925|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"練習あるのみ！"},{"form_id":"0x0038C0|skyrimsgottalent-bards.esp","type":"MESG DESC","string":"やれやれ、せめてこれで終わりか..."}]